[{"client_msg_id":"88b98b11-aefc-4cce-8b1c-5bd9d030c355","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"`Deno.symlink` は上書きしてくれないっぽいのでとりあえずナシに\nまあちゃんとハンドリングしてあげればいいだけの話なんですけど面倒なので","ts":"1633774531.255800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cv2U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"539f5094-b493-42c8-9664-75e64b7cb844","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ですね","ts":"1633772625.255000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oo7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"44e395b7-b394-453f-93cc-37054fd9fe4e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"試してみたらちゃんとシンボリックリンクが張れた\nただpipとかnpmとかbrewとか叩かせたいならzxが楽そうですね","ts":"1633772086.254800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CrYAD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b18dd1c7-680b-4303-9297-51effd519fa0","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"つまりzx外せるのでは :thinking-sun:","ts":"1633771005.253800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jid"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f6c5003-f666-49ad-acfc-9a67f3c304f7","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Deno.symlinkか","ts":"1633770978.253300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBRL="}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cea0581-1bfa-4b25-ab03-f1f164f93683","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"シンボリックリンクもDenoで張れますね","ts":"1633770938.252900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IeT4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee16b0be-87d2-4dde-84c5-6c15141e683d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これ本末転倒感が","ts":"1633767771.252300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nqJI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aa05ec6-c9a7-4fd9-b12c-ac7880eac38e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"これディレクトリ掘ってファイル分けした方が見通し良さそう","ts":"1633767744.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6TBk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64859F3B-44C0-47DC-980F-8FA6CB9E1DB2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zenoのexecute、もしかしてzx使うのが一番いいのでは\nzsh密結合だし","ts":"1633766426.250700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XJD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a01fb4e1-d4cc-4ae8-9fec-1288b4898eb2","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"最終的にその辺もやるつもりでいます\nというかcatで取得して改行ベースでスライスしてforで回せばいいだけなので楽勝ですね","ts":"1633766410.250300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lzP96"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08C5148D-06FC-4E09-89E9-E94965721F52","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分がやるのはbrew install叩くとかかなぁ","ts":"1633766365.248700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9oUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"497E8B10-DDFD-49C9-AF94-2FF8C8384C2D","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"便利","ts":"1633766339.248000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cri"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3145a8e3-ce9b-4518-8ec0-2d6b091663c1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ファイル一覧をDenoのAPIで再帰的に取得しながらリンク張りたくないやつだけswitchで排除して、最後のそのリストをforで回してリンク張る、で動きました","ts":"1633766318.247800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"za2v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97A9385A-A3F6-4C4F-BFBE-FAAA0AA532C2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"色々事前にやってからデプロイスクリプトを叩く処理とかになるのかなやっぱり","ts":"1633766262.247100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/42"}]},{"client_msg_id":"607a317d-6f58-4a67-91e9-67f7635c10b5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"シンボリックリンク張る部分だけ脳死しました\nここも調べればAPIありそうだな……","ts":"1633766225.246200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aya5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20F8594A-9052-45C6-B0E1-C5A36173E61C","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"めっちゃありそうで笑う\nファイル読む時にcat使うとかの方が思考停止できて楽とかくらいでは","ts":"1633766180.245800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"t6uE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43bd1e63-82b4-45f6-b3df-75fd553d2570","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"zx_deno使ってみたら一箇所でしか使ってなくて笑ってしまった\nほぼDenoのAPIで片付いてしまう","ts":"1633765628.244400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"benri","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=/r"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7652a0a2-8d12-4d75-b29c-0532d803540e","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"便利そう","ts":"1633765409.243100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z67"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34df25ac-40cf-4007-a4db-e6ff3b1028d8","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"インフラエンジニアを20年やってて初めて知ったtopコマンドの表示を劇的に見やすくする方法 | 株式会社ビヨンド (\u003chttp://beyondjapan.com|beyondjapan.com\u003e\u003chttps://beyondjapan.com/blog/2021/10/tips_for_top_command/|)\u003e","ts":"1633765400.242700","attachments":[{"fallback":"株式会社ビヨンド: インフラエンジニアを20年やってて初めて知ったtopコマンドの表示を劇的に見やすくする方法 | 株式会社ビヨンド","id":1,"title":"インフラエンジニアを20年やってて初めて知ったtopコマンドの表示を劇的に見やすくする方法 | 株式会社ビヨンド","title_link":"https://beyondjapan.com/blog/2021/10/tips_for_top_command/","text":"何年やってても知らないこと、知っているつもりでも新しい発見ってあるんですね。自分の固定観念にとらわれず柔らかい頭であり続けることの大切さを痛感しています。インフラエンジニアならみんな大好きtopコマンドの便利な使い方を記事にしてみました。","image_url":"https://beyondjapan.com/cms/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/top.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1633310800,"service_name":"株式会社ビヨンド","service_icon":"https://beyondjapan.com/cms/wp-content/themes/